    "Cue has no server. Your scripts, takes and Creator Voice are stored on this device and in your device backups. Sign in with Apple is optional and only keeps your Apple ID on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ليس لدى Cue خادم. تُحفظ نصوصك ولقطاتك وCreator Voice على هذا الجهاز وفي نسخه الاحتياطية. تسجيل الدخول باستخدام Apple اختياري ويحتفظ فقط بحساب Apple الخاص بك على هذا الـ iPhone."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue hat keinen Server. Deine Skripte, Takes und Creator Voice liegen auf diesem Gerät und in seinen Backups. Mit Apple anmelden ist optional und speichert nur deinen Apple Account auf diesem iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue no tiene servidor. Tus guiones, tomas y Creator Voice se guardan en este dispositivo y en sus copias de seguridad. Iniciar sesión con Apple es opcional y solo guarda tu Apple ID en este iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue n’a pas de serveur. Vos scripts, prises et Creator Voice sont stockés sur cet appareil et dans ses sauvegardes. La connexion avec Apple est facultative et ne garde que votre identifiant Apple sur cet iPhone."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue का कोई सर्वर नहीं है। आपकी स्क्रिप्ट, टेक और Creator Voice इसी डिवाइस और उसके बैकअप में रहते हैं। Apple से साइन इन करना वैकल्पिक है और यह इस iPhone पर सिर्फ़ आपका Apple अकाउंट रखता है।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue tidak punya server. Naskah, take, dan Creator Voice-mu disimpan di perangkat ini dan cadangannya. Masuk dengan Apple bersifat opsional dan hanya menyimpan Akun Apple-mu di iPhone ini."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue non ha server. Copioni, riprese e Creator Voice restano su questo dispositivo e nei suoi backup. L’accesso con Apple è facoltativo e conserva solo il tuo Apple ID su questo iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cueにはサーバーがありません。台本、テイク、Creator Voiceはこのデバイスとそのバックアップに保存されます。Appleでサインインは任意で、このiPhoneにApple Accountだけを保存します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue에는 서버가 없어요. 대본, 테이크, Creator Voice는 이 기기와 기기 백업에 저장돼요. Apple로 로그인은 선택 사항이고 이 iPhone에 Apple 계정만 저장해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Cue não tem servidor. Seus roteiros, takes e Creator Voice ficam neste aparelho e nos backups dele. Entrar com a Apple é opcional e só guarda seu ID Apple neste iPhone."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue ไม่มีเซิร์ฟเวอร์ สคริปต์ เทค และ Creator Voice ของคุณเก็บไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้และในข้อมูลสำรองของอุปกรณ์ การลงชื่อเข้าด้วย Apple เป็นตัวเลือก และเก็บแค่บัญชี Apple ของคุณไว้ใน iPhone เครื่องนี้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue'nun sunucusu yok. Senaryoların, çekimlerin ve Creator Voice bu aygıtta ve yedeklerinde saklanır. Apple ile giriş isteğe bağlıdır ve yalnızca Apple Hesabı'nı bu iPhone'da tutar."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue không có máy chủ. Kịch bản, cảnh quay và Creator Voice được lưu trên thiết bị này và trong bản sao lưu của thiết bị. Đăng nhập bằng Apple là tùy chọn và chỉ lưu Tài khoản Apple của bạn trên iPhone này."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cue 没有服务器。你的脚本、镜头和 Creator Voice 都存储在这台设备及其备份中。通过 Apple 登录是可选的，只会在这台 iPhone 上保留你的 Apple 账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cue reads the language from what you write" : {
